    "quote": "Caste-specific allometric patterns are often taken as evidence of functional differences between queen and worker castes (Hunt et al., 1996), or among worker subcastes (Wilson, 1953; Oster & Wilson, 1978; Diniz et al., 1994; Fraser et al., 2000; Schoning, Kinuthia & Franks, 2005).",
