    "quote": "Our results are consistent with those obtained from analysing traits in sexually, as opposed to caste, dimorphic species (Lande, 1980; Reeve & Fairbairn, 1996, 2001; Ashman, 2003; Bonduriansky & Rowe, 2005; Fairbairn & Roff, 2006; Fedorka, Winterhalter & Mousseau, 2007; Steven, Delph & Brodie, 2007; Bonduriansky & Chenoweth, 2009).",
